# AI Labour Market Policy Proposal

This repository contains my Assessment 2 policy proposal for ECON1626. The proposal examines how generative AI may affect entry-level knowledge work in Australia and recommends a policy package to manage labour-market disruption while supporting productivity growth.

## Repository Structure

- `proposal.md` contains the full policy proposal.
- `README.md` explains the purpose and structure of this repository.

## Topic

Managing AI-driven disruption of entry-level knowledge work in Australia.

## Policy Client

Deputy Secretary, Employment and Skills, Australian Government Department of Employment and Workplace Relations.